"`packaging/docker/compose.yaml` uses the published image: `docker compose "
"pull`, then `docker compose up -d`."
msgstr ""
"`packaging/docker/compose.yaml` yayımlanan imajı kullanır: `docker compose "
"pull`, ardından `docker compose up -d`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/server.md
